=== AI SDR COPILOT - COMPLETE SYSTEM & TECHNICAL OVERVIEW ===

AI SDR COPILOT SYSTEM SUMMARY

1. OVERVIEW:
AI SDR Copilot is an enterprise-grade AI Sales Development Representative Assistant built with Python, Django 5, MySQL, OpenAI API, LangGraph, ChromaDB, PyPDF2, and Bootstrap 5.

2. PDF FEATURES IN THIS PROJECT:
- Ingestion & Extraction: Upload PDF sales collateral in the RAG Knowledge Base. Extracted using PyPDF2 and indexed into ChromaDB vector store.
- PDF Report Export: 1-Click export of Company Research Briefs, Sales Outreach Pitches, and AI Sales Copilot Chat Sessions as ReportLab PDF downloads.

3. PDF ENDPOINTS:
- GET /research/<id>/pdf/ - Download Research Brief PDF
- GET /outreach/<id>/pdf/ - Download Outreach Pitch PDF
- GET /chat/<id>/pdf/ - Download Chat Session PDF
- POST /rag/ - Upload & Index Sales PDF Collateral

4. TECH STACK:
- Framework: Django 5.0+
- Database: MySQL 8.0+ & ChromaDB Vector Store
- PDF Engine: ReportLab & PyPDF2
- AI Engine: OpenAI GPT-4o-mini & LangGraph StateGraph

